Package: phenoconverter
Type: Package
Title: Convert Activity Scores Into Phenoconversion Corrected Activity Scores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Siobhan", "Lock",
              role = c("aut", "cre"),
              email = "locksk@cardiff.ac.uk",
              comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-8574-8391")))
Maintainer: Siobhan <locksk@cardiff.ac.uk>
Description: A package to convert activity scores into phenocovnersion-corrected activity scores to account for the roles of inhibitors and induces on pharamcogenomically-inferred enzyme activity. 
    Inducer/Inhibtior information derived from the World Health Organisation.
    Currently works on - CYP1A2, CYP2D6, CYP2C19, CYP2C9, CYP3A4, CYP3A5.
